notes.notes:
Hello everyone.
I spent some time implementing the first game update basing on received feedback(YT, curators).

[list]
[*]Shooting range increased (Ak/M4)  ~ +150%;
[*]The player camera switched from third-person to the first-person view during traveling at ZIP line and vice versa;
[*]Added recoil at all weapons;
[*]Added muzzle flashlight in addition to existing particle system for (AK/M4);
[*]Level 01 design minor changes to gracefully introduce SWAT dialog mechanic - too many players skip it, just because it's not obvious - not receive additional crystals and is lead to frustration later on at last unlockable ZIP-line;
[*]Level 04 minor tweak near first ZIP-line;
[*]Player slowing down walking speed when reloading a weapon (more realistic move);
[*]Still no jump, yup just like in latest 'God-of-war';
[*]New popup with 4 variants of text, when player interact with un-lockable door(some players was confused);
[*]Damage splash widget returned back(only when player armor < 0) - so players without sound/headphones;
[*]Fixed few typo mistakes in the bad ending;
[*]M4-related achievement now acts immediately (no at the end of the level);
[*]All available textures boosted to the highest resolution (up to 2K in some cases);

[*]Post-processing filters adjusted/added to all levels - picture became more interesting, but the game now requires more or less modern GPU (now it's the main bottleneck for decent frame rate);
[/list]


P.S. If you find some mistakes at in-game dairies text - please let me know.
--
Thank you.
Sergey R.
